Say, item by item, what a run found pinned and what it found free

Usage: njutest spec [OPTIONS] [SUBJECT]

Arguments:
  [SUBJECT]  What to specify: a file, an item as the source names it, or `PATH:ITEM`. Every item the
             run changed by default

Options:
      --run <RUN>  The run to read. The latest by default
  -h, --help       Print help
